@{
    Layout = null;
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>503 - Service Unavailable</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --color-bg: #050a05;
            --color-main: #39ff14;
            --color-text: #e0e0e0;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            background-color: var(--color-bg);
            font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
            color: var(--color-text);
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }
        .gear-container {
            font-size: 5rem;
            color: var(--color-main);
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .gear {
            animation: rotate 4s infinite linear;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .gear-rev {
            animation: rotate-rev 4s infinite linear;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .error-code {
            font-size: 7rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--color-main);
            letter-spacing: 10px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--color-main);
        }
        .message-title {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .message-desc {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 500px;
        }
        .btn-back {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--color-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--color-main);
            padding: 10px 30px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-back:hover {
            background-color: var(--color-main);
            color: var(--color-bg);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--color-main);
        }
        @@keyframes rotate { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        @@keyframes rotate-rev { from { transform: rotate(360deg); } to { transform: rotate(0deg); } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="gear-container">
        <span class="gear">⚙</span>
        <span class="gear-rev">⚙</span>
    </div>
    <div class="error-code">503</div>
    <div class="message-title">UNDER MAINTENANCE</div>
    <p class="message-desc">
        Hệ thống đang được nâng cấp để mang lại trải nghiệm tốt hơn.<br>
        Chúng tôi sẽ trở lại trong giây lát.
    </p>
    <a href="/" class="btn-back">KIỂM TRA LẠI</a>
</body>
</html>